{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:PredictedSpectra.AntiparticleCrossingReversal","@type":"LeanModule","name":"PredictedSpectra.AntiparticleCrossingReversal","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Invertible.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.antiparticle_crossing_reversal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.antiparticle_crossing_reversal","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/antiparticle-crossing-reversal.lean#L88-L99","doc":"**Antiparticles from crossing reversal** (narrative claims 2–4 bundled).\nThe mirror operation σ on a knot composite reverses the crossing energy under\nthe bar-involution `q ↦ q⁻¹`, reverses the Coulomb charge, and preserves the\nbare mass.  (Claim 1 — that σ *defines* the antiparticle — is the definition\nof `KnotComposite.mirror` itself.) ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:antiparticle-crossing-reversal","label":"prop:antiparticle-crossing-reversal","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/antiparticle-crossing-reversal.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.bare_mass_invariance","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.bare_mass_invariance","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/antiparticle-crossing-reversal.lean#L79-L86","doc":"**Bare-mass invariance** (narrative claim 4): the mirror preserves the total\ncrossing count (hence the knot type and its hyperbolic volume), so a particle\nand its antiparticle have equal bare mass. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.coulomb_reversal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.coulomb_reversal","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/antiparticle-crossing-reversal.lean#L71-L77","doc":"**Coulomb-charge reversal** (narrative claim 3):\n`Q(𝔥^σ) = −Q(𝔥)`; in particular `Q(𝔭^σ) = −1` for the antiproton. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.crossing_energy_bar_reversal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.crossing_energy_bar_reversal","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/antiparticle-crossing-reversal.lean#L61-L69","doc":"**Crossing-energy bar-reversal** (narrative claim 2):\n`𝔈(𝔥^σ) = −𝔈(𝔥)|_{q ↦ q⁻¹}` — positive crossings `+q` become negative\n`−q⁻¹` and vice versa under the mirror. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.KnotComposite.coulombCharge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.KnotComposite.coulombCharge","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/antiparticle-crossing-reversal.lean#L55-L58","doc":"Coulomb charge: antisymmetric component of the crossing energy. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.KnotComposite.mirror","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.KnotComposite.mirror","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/antiparticle-crossing-reversal.lean#L49-L53","doc":"Mirror operation: swap positive and negative crossings. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.KnotComposite.barCrossingEnergy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.KnotComposite.barCrossingEnergy","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/antiparticle-crossing-reversal.lean#L45-L47","doc":"Bar-involution `q ↦ q⁻¹` applied to the crossing energy. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.KnotComposite.crossingEnergy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.KnotComposite.crossingEnergy","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/antiparticle-crossing-reversal.lean#L41-L43","doc":"Crossing energy: `+q` per positive crossing, `-q⁻¹` per negative crossing. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.KnotComposite.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.KnotComposite.q","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/antiparticle-crossing-reversal.lean#L39-L39","doc":"Substrate parameter `q`, carried as a unit (§7c). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.KnotComposite.neg_crossings","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.KnotComposite.neg_crossings","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/antiparticle-crossing-reversal.lean#L37-L37","doc":"Number of negative crossings. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.KnotComposite.pos_crossings","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.KnotComposite.pos_crossings","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/antiparticle-crossing-reversal.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Number of positive crossings. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.KnotComposite.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.KnotComposite.mk","kind":"ctor","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/antiparticle-crossing-reversal.lean#L33-L33","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.KnotComposite","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.KnotComposite","kind":"structure","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/antiparticle-crossing-reversal.lean#L32-L39","doc":"A knot composite with crossing counts and a substrate parameter `q`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}